{"id":"7025c557a0eee5f3","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-one-counter-context-free.md","title":"一个计数器的语言是上下文无关语言","display":"thm-one-counter-context-free — 一个计数器的语言是上下文无关语言","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-one-counter-context-free","aliases":["73-thm-one-counter-context-free"],"display":"thm-one-counter-context-free — 一个计数器的语言是上下文无关语言","depends_on":["[[73-df-endmarked-counter-machine]]","[[73-df-cfg-language-class]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§8.5.4, print p. 359; PDF p. 381; explicitly proved CFL inclusion","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":8},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-one-counter-context-free"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-one-counter-context-free</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-one-counter-context-free — 一个计数器的语言是上下文无关语言"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"568502bf56055515\" href=\"?note=568502bf56055515\" title=\"73-df-endmarked-counter-machine\">73-df-endmarked-counter-machine</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"83639a9615c06195\" href=\"?note=83639a9615c06195\" title=\"73-df-cfg-language-class\">73-df-cfg-language-class</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§8.5.4, print p. 359; PDF p. 381; explicitly proved CFL inclusion"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"8"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CounterMachine}_{\\Sigma,1}(M)\">\\(\\operatorname{CounterMachine}_{\\Sigma,1}(M)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L=L_{\\mathsf{ctr}}(M)\">\\(L=L_{\\mathsf{ctr}}(M)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_\\Sigma.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[L\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_\\Sigma.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>PDA 以 XⁿZ₀ 保存计数 n，栈顶只分零与非零。计数器机有输入结束字符而普通 PDA 没有，因此 PDA 非确定地猜测输入已经结束，再用 ε 动作模拟读结束字符；若猜早了，余词非空使终态不接受。教材还陈述可由不带结束标记的 DPDA 接受，但明确说不处理那一较难证明，本条只给已完整说明的 CFL 包含。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-endmarked-counter-machine","status":"resolved","id":"568502bf56055515","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-endmarked-counter-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-language-class","status":"resolved","id":"83639a9615c06195","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-language-class]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CounterMachine}_{\\Sigma,1}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"L=L_{\\mathsf{ctr}}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"L\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_\\Sigma.","display":true}],"bytes":1390,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-186","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-one-counter-context-free|一个计数器的语言是上下文无关语言]] （本轮新建）"}],"outgoing":["568502bf56055515","83639a9615c06195"]}